node_modules/
dist/
*.log
# DB lives outside the repo, but ignore any stray local copies
*.sqlite
*.sqlite-shm
*.sqlite-wal
.DS_Store

# `npm run backup` (backup-snapshot.cmd) writes dated-range snapshots into
# backups/ on purpose — you review and `git push` them yourself. They contain
# real customer data (phone numbers, names); see README's Data & backup section
# before pushing if you're not already sure this repo should hold that.
!backups/*.sqlite
